<title>USA: CSCE changes BFP milk options launch to April 11.</title>
<headline>CSCE changes BFP milk options launch to April 11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange (CSCE) said Thursday its new BFP milk options will begin trading on April 11, 1997, instead of the previously announced date of April 15.</p>
<p>The change was prompted by requests from floor brokers who asked that the options market be opened earlier, the exchange said.</p>
<p>The CSCE will launch trading on BFP milk futures contract on April 8, 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
